---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { LINKS, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<Base title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Who is behind Curious Ankit, and why these notes exist.">
  <section class="wrap page">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I am Ankit, a business analyst based in Melbourne. For more than twelve years I have worked
        on digital transformation, procurement and software delivery, and I teach business analysis
        and Agile delivery to postgraduate students at Monash University.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is my notebook for learning AI in the open. It holds the experiments I run, the
        courses I take, the things that worked and the things that did not. It is not a polished
        portfolio. It is a record of me getting better at something, and I hope it is useful to
        anyone a few steps behind me or alongside me.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site itself is built with Astro and written, in part, with the help of AI, which seems
        the right way to document it.
      </p>
      <p class="elsewhere">
        <a href={`mailto:${LINKS.email}`}>Email</a>
        <a href={LINKS.home} target="_blank" rel="noopener">ank1t.com</a>
        {
          LINKS.linkedin && (
            <a href={LINKS.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              LinkedIn
            </a>
          )
        }
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 4rem;
  }
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 40rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .elsewhere {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem 1.6rem;
    margin-top: 2.4rem;
    padding-top: 1.3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
</style>
